<title>USA: Primex wins $26 mln Air Force contract.</title>
<headline>Primex wins $26 mln Air Force contract.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primex Technologies Inc said Tuesday the Air Force System Support Management and Lockheed Martin Co had selected its Primex Aerospace Co unit for combined awards of $26 million for F-16 electronic ground support equipment.</p>
<p>Primex said it has supplied such equipment since the 1970s and is currently the designated end item manufacturer.</p>
<p>The contract award calls for systems delivery in 1998 and 1999, it said.</p>
</text>
